{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf19 NightBreak</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the middle of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside your prison cell. <br>Most of the prison is quiet\u2026 but guards are still on patrol and searchlights sweep the yard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This might be your only chance to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>NightBreak</strong>, you and your friends play as inmates trying to break out of a heavily guarded prison during the night. Move carefully through the corridors, avoid the lights, search for tools, unlock doors, and find a way out together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one mistake can give away your position. <br>Step into the light\u2026 or make too much noise\u2026 and the guards will know where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, stay out of the light, stay quiet, and make it out before the prison wakes up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Co-op Prison Escape</strong> <br>Play with friends and coordinate your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Avoid the Light</strong> <br>Searchlights and lit areas can reveal your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a <strong>Noise Matters</strong> <br>Run, drop objects, or slam doors too loudly and guards may investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda <strong>Explore the Prison</strong> <br>Cells, corridors, tunnels, and hidden areas full of useful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Find Tools &amp; Unlock Paths</strong> <br>Search the prison to find keys, tools, and ways to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Chaos With Friends</strong> <br>Even the best escape plan can fall apart in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Join the Discord to share ideas, report bugs, or scream together: <br></p>