osition. <br>Step into the light\u2026 or make too much noise\u2026 and the guards will know where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, stay out of the light, stay quiet, and make it out before the prison wakes up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Co-op Prison Escape</strong> <br>Play with friends and coordinate your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Avoid the Light</strong> <br>Searchlights and lit areas can reveal your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a <strong>Noise Matters</strong> <br>Run, drop objects, or slam doors too loudly and guards may investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda <strong>Explore the Prison</strong> <br>Cells, corridors, tunnels, and hidden areas full of useful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Find Tools &amp; Unlock Paths</strong> <br>Search the prison to find keys, tools, and ways to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Chaos With Friends</strong> <br>Even the best escape plan can fall apart in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Join the Discord to share ideas, report bugs, or scream together: <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third-Party Credits:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Headlamp</i> by NameSsis, licensed under CC BY 4.0.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Icons made by Freepik from </p></li></ul>","developers":["Davin Cl\u00e9ment"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Davin ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744640/d7e1988312a2c3425102c165a623e151c3f0e6aa/header.jpg?t=1773847137","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Ic\u00f4nes de Widget venant de https://www.flatico